    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use bombs to move around and reach the top of a world full of obstacles\u2014and find help to regain your human form. Watch out for falls! Are you ready to take on this challenge?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vital Informations</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a skeleton planted in a flower pot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No one really knows why.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to reach the top and meet someone who might help you become human again. <i>People in this world are extremely nice.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the left mouse button to aim where you want to throw the bomb. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release the left mouse button to launch the bomb. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the right mouse button to control the power of the explosion. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release the right mouse button to trigger the explosion, or keep holding it until it reaches max power. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pretty simple, right?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visuals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful pixel art world with a (roughly) medieval fantasy setting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Never seen before :O</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sound Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music and sound effects worthy of the greatest masterpieces. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Well\u2026 okay\u2026 you can turn the music off if you don\u2019t like it, but I doubt that. D:</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumor has it that some stylish outfits are hidden throughout the game\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Some aren\u2019t that well hidden\u2026</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And then?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you finish the game and its various possible endings but still want more, each zone has its own set of unique challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pssst\u2026 that\u2019s for the experts. :)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >To finish</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your marks, get set\u2026 fall!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is inspired by the legendary <u>Jump King by Nexile</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosion animation :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer's music :\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Take a Chance&quot; Kevin MacLeod </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0 License</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p>",
