d its various possible endings but still want more, each zone has its own set of unique challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pssst\u2026 that\u2019s for the experts. :)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >To finish</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your marks, get set\u2026 fall!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is inspired by the legendary <u>Jump King by Nexile</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosion animation :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer's music :\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Take a Chance&quot; Kevin MacLeod </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0 License</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p>",
